      en: ["The estate covers an area of nearly 20 square kilometers in Puerto Triunfo.", "It is home to the only wild hippopotamus herd in the world outside of Africa.", "A dedicated museum documents Colombia's history of fighting drug trafficking.", "The site was officially repurposed and opened as a theme park in the late 2000s.", "The park includes several water attractions, such as the famous Octopus pool.", "Visitors can still see the original plane used for Escobar's first cocaine shipments."],
